msgid "Schema.org Article"
msgstr "Schema.org Article"

msgid "Adds Schema.org/Article to the JSON LD array. Creates Article, BlogPosting, SocialMediaPosting, Report, ScholarlyArticle, TechArticle or APIReference."
msgstr "Hiermee wordt Schema.org/Article toegevoegd aan de JSON LD-array. Gemaakt wordt: Article, BlogPosting, SocialMediaPosting, Report, ScholarlyArticle, TechArticle of APIReference."

